{"data":[{"author_id":"1531801543","created_at":"2026-10-24T04:00:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113842920428130700"],"id":"2113842920428130700","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3558,"like_count":20,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":6},"text":"【央行將開展7000億元MLF操作】中國人民銀行10月23日發布公告稱，為保持銀行體系流動性充裕，將於10月26日以固定數量、利率招標、多重價位中標方式開展7000億元中期借貸便利（MLF）操作，期限為1年期。  \n\n由於10月有9000億元MLF到期，這意味著本月MLF縮量續作2000億元。 https://t.co/ChJSPuyuiq","url":"https://x.com/PDChinese/status/2113842920428130700"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-24T03:45:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113839221937217755"],"id":"2113839221937217755","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4959,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"天然橡胶原料继续上涨 https://t.co/spaLQtBIN6","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2113839221937217755"},{"author_id":"1938963008","created_at":"2026-10-24T03:29:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113835342243754471"],"id":"2113835342243754471","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":6640,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":4},"text":"MeToo(手术室版)\n\n该视频内容严重违反医疗无菌原则Aseptic Technique。 https://t.co/HQvS82VSha","url":"https://x.com/HotmailfromSH/status/2113835342243754471"},{"author_id":"3460383084","created_at":"2026-10-24T03:28:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113835056938766785"],"id":"2113835056938766785","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":6080,"like_count":33,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":2},"text":"🔥 习近平竟是小学生？！\n\n官方履历显示，习近平拥有清华大学法学博士学位。\n\n但有网友翻出习近平早年的个人档案及登记表，其基础教育经历显示，他当年初中都没毕业！ https://t.co/aVTEIOF8pE","url":"https://x.com/TruthMedia123/status/2113835056938766785"},{"author_id":"3460383084","created_at":"2026-10-24T03:24:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113834102969569711"],"id":"2113834102969569711","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_coun