后，似乎不是急着远离危险，而是想赶往现场捡拾残骸，当废品卖钱。 https://t.co/WoFki3UloS","url":"https://x.com/TruthMedia123/status/2113829776926683188"},{"author_id":"3460383084","created_at":"2026-10-24T03:06:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113829415256023363"],"id":"2113829415256023363","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":34,"impression_count":44932,"like_count":178,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":91,"retweet_count":31},"text":"🚨南京景区警察查手机！\n\n网传视频显示，在南京钟山风景区梧桐大道（陵园路），一名女子遭警察拦截并要求检查手机。面对这一要求，女子奋力夺回自己的手机！ https://t.co/jvgeUlns2V","url":"https://x.com/TruthMedia123/status/2113829415256023363"},{"author_id":"55964567","created_at":"2026-10-24T02:52:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113825862403719532"],"id":"2113825862403719532","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3759,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"参观：20万$造了个ADU\n1000尺，相当于中国的120平。\n二室两卫一厅．\n贵不？ https://t.co/XSwMu4v2UY","url":"https://x.com/wuzuolai/status/2113825862403719532"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-24T02:49:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113825120456454226"],"id":"2113825120456454226","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":51,"impression_count":10326,"like_count":104,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":15},"text":"绝大多数人理解现实的思考框架，只停留在信息差这一层。他们每天获取大量信息，追逐热点，关注趋势，却很少思考信息背后的因果关系。信息差决定你能否发现机会。认知差决定你能否理解机会。能力差决定你能否把机会变成结果。资源差决定你能否扩大结果。结构差决定结果能否持续存在。","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2113825120456454226"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-24T02:43:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113823758352044457"],"id":"2113823758352044457","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":24,"impression_count":9013,"like_count":146,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":18},"text":"投资，不追求赢的次数和胜率，而是赢的时候赚得足够多，输的时候亏得足够少，让自己始终留在牌桌上。","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2113823758352044457"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-24T02:35:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113821621635182963"],"id":"2113821621635182963","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":50,"impression_count":10728,"like_count":202,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":21},"text":"愚蠢的人，从信息中获取情绪；聪明的人，从信息中提取价值。","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2113821621635182963"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-24T02:32:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113820832296473006"],"id":"2113820832296473006","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":193,"impression_count":17182,"like_count":432,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":53},"text":"人在低谷时，最好的杠杆：不是在原有业务上盲目加倍努力，而是学习、复盘、休息、管理情绪、保持健康、降低负债、控制开支、储备现金、维持现金流、减少无效社交、远离消耗性关系、认清能力边界、提升技能、拓展认知、研究周期、观察市场、重新审视方向、小规模试错、停止无效投入、保护注意力、保持耐","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2113820832296473006"},{"author_id":"1954166149","created_at":"2026-10-24T02:28:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113819917971866026"],"id":"2113819917971866026","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":9171,"like_count":60,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":37,"retweet_count":1},"text":"PEPE又跌回来了\n\n全都白赚\n\n昨天晚上吃海鲜\n\n今天晚上只能吃泡面了\n\n离翻身又远了一步","url":"https://x.com/monkeyjiang/status/2113819917971866026"},{"author_id":"855303666722525184","created_at":"2026-10-24T02:25:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113819017345700047"],"id":"2113819017345700047","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":4072,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":3},"text":"网文作者用AI的三个套路，我看了一圈确实有人在这么干。\n\n第一种：架空历史。找AI调查资料，然后让它从某个历史人物视角重新铺陈整个世界观。听起来简单，但现在会这招的作者已经一大堆了，得仔细琢磨别人怎么做的才行。","url":"https://x.com/wanerfu/status/2113819017345700047"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-24T02:22:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113818360467349911"],"id":"2113818360467349911","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":62,"impression_count":8269,"like_count":131,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":14},"text":"机会不一定留给最有准备的人，而是更愿意交给稳定、可靠、可预期的人。因为机会的背后是信任，信任的背后是风险。能力决定你能不能抓住机会，稳定性